title: Coal Mine (Diamond, Bracelet)
story: dungeo
description: Navigate coal mine, collect 2 treasures (diamond, bracelet),
  toggle mirror back to State A. Restores from wt-10.

---

# Restore state from wt-10 (player at Living Room with torch and lantern)
$restore wt-10

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Enter the Coal Mine via Mirror Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Enter Coal Mine]

# Pick up lantern (dropped in wt-07, sitting in Living Room)
> take lantern

# Navigate to Mirror Room: Living Room → Cellar → Troll Room → E/W Passage → Round Room → Winding Passage → Mirror Room
> down

> east

> north

> east

> southeast

> east

# Toggle mirror to State B (Coal Mine connections)
> rub mirror

# Navigate: Mirror Room → Cold Passage → Slide Room → Mine Entrance
> west

> west

> north

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get sapphire bracelet from Gas Room (drop torch first!)
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get sapphire bracelet safely]

# Mine Entrance → NE → Shaft Room (avoid Squeaky Room NW - bat attack!)
> northeast

# Shaft Room → N → Wooden Tunnel → W → Smelly Room
> north

> west

# CRITICAL: Drop torch before entering Gas Room (flame + gas = explosion death)
> drop torch

> turn on lantern

# Enter Gas Room (safe with lantern only)
> down

> take bracelet

# Return to Smelly Room
> up

# Retrieve torch
> take torch

> turn off lantern

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get coal from Dead End and make diamond
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get coal and make diamond]

# Navigate through mine maze to Coal Mine Dead End
# Smelly Room → E → Wooden Tunnel → NE → Mine Maze path
> east

> northeast

> north

> northeast

> northwest

# Mine Maze 7 → down through Ladders to Dead End
> down

> down

> northeast

> take coal

# Navigate to Machine Room: Dead End → S → Ladder Bottom → S → Timber → SW → Bottom of Shaft → E
> south

> south

> southwest

> east

# Coal machine puzzle: put coal in, turn switch, get diamond
> put coal in machine

> turn switch

> take diamond

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Return to Living Room via Mirror Room (toggle back to State A)
# Route: Machine Room → Mine Entrance → Slide Room → Cold Passage → Mirror Room
# → rub mirror → Winding Passage → Round Room → Troll Room → Cellar → Living Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Return via Mirror Room]

# Navigate back through deep mine to Mine Entrance
# Machine Room → NW → Bottom of Shaft → NE → Timber → N → Ladder Bottom
> northwest

> northeast

> north

# Ladder Bottom → Up → Ladder Top → Up → Mine Maze 7
> up

> up

# Mine Maze 7 → E → Mine Maze 1 → E → Wooden Tunnel
> east

> east

# Wooden Tunnel → S → Shaft Room → W → Mine Entrance
> south

> west

# Mine Entrance → S → Slide Room → E → Cold Passage → E → Mirror Room
> south

> east

> east

# Toggle mirror back to State A (restores upper-world connections)
> rub mirror

# Exit via Winding Passage (State A west connection)
> west

> northwest

> west

> west

> west

> up

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case (diamond + bracelet)
# Red sphere moved to wt-11 (collected via slide after jade figurine)
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case]

> inventory

> open trophy case

> put diamond in trophy case

> put bracelet in trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify final state
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Verify state for next segment]

> inventory

> look

[END GOAL]

$save wt-11
